<title>USA: Charles Schwab Corp Q1 shr increases.</title>
<headline>Charles Schwab Corp Q1 shr increases.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in millions, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>							    Three Months</p>
<p>								 Ended</p>
<p>								March 31,</p>
<p>								  1997   1996</p>
<p>Revenues</p>
<p>   Commissions					    $274.9 $240.9</p>
